Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/crl2pkcs7.c
Line: 136
Function: crl2pkcs7_main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: p7s->contents is never initialized after PKCS7_SIGNED_new(); dereferencing p7s->contents->type will dereference a NULL pointer. A PKCS7 object for contents must be allocated (e.g., via PKCS7_content_new or PKCS7_new) before accessing its fields.

